.Dd October 24, 2026
.Dt UPTIME 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm uptime
.Nd show how long the system has been running
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the current time, how long the system has been up, the number of
users logged in and the load averages over the last 1, 5 and 15 minutes.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr getloadavg 3 ,
.Xr sysctl 3 ,
.Xr getutxent 3
